This project is derived from ascii-sharks by stackedlol
(https://github.com/stackedlol/ascii-sharks). The original shark simulation and
procedural ASCII rendering are by the original author. ascii-things adds the
library API, packaging, palettes, seeded worlds, accessibility options,
framework adapters, and the robot scene.

